                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab536b5d-d56e-3b0b-9e4c-b695d2e98d49",
                                        "entry_id": "ba4c0573-8267-3c82-bef6-570dc06963f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characterized by greenness or lushness; verdant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d79a5a40-b85f-4edd-bf46-fa1dc2e5cacd",
                                                "sense_id": "ab536b5d-d56e-3b0b-9e4c-b695d2e98d49",
                                                "text": "How then is it possible that Methodism, that is, a religion of the heart, though it flourishes now as a greenly tree, should continue in this state?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "greenly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa03182d-ea55-3fe0-bab8-88f414e42c49",
                                        "entry_id": "aa85ef8f-bc6d-3cbe-bf70-6b44f5e115ea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "With a green color."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc2e6f5d-45be-4251-9447-ff8471893e9d",
                                                "sense_id": "aa03182d-ea55-3fe0-bab8-88f414e42c49",
                                                "text": "What was that gleaming greenly on Mother's hand? A ring . . . Dad's present."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "284f61e2-301a-428c-b479-e119009113a8",
                                                "sense_id": "aa03182d-ea55-3fe0-bab8-88f414e42c49",
                                                "text": "But within this swarded circle, into which the lime-walk brings us —\nWhence the beeches rounded greenly, stand away in reverent fear;\nI will let no music enter, saving what the fountain sings us […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "def7b53a-617f-4e56-86cd-c4c691bc1e93",
                                                "sense_id": "aa03182d-ea55-3fe0-bab8-88f414e42c49",
                                                "text": "Sylvia loved dancing, and knew \"wall flowers\" only by sight; therefore she was busy; her lover's gift shone greenly in bosom, hair, and fleecy skirts[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c87d1bf5-bbef-363f-a2ea-0f9b71a29733",
                                        "entry_id": "aa85ef8f-bc6d-3cbe-bf70-6b44f5e115ea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a naive or immature manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8259b98-59b7-4382-af5e-830141e10b73",
                                                "sense_id": "c87d1bf5-bbef-363f-a2ea-0f9b71a29733",
                                                "text": "They […] proposed that we should join them in a plan to drench the president next morning with freezing water. We consented greenly enough."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3b52198c-b103-4bb9-9bc9-663022f4a353",
                        "source_entry_id": "cfcdec57-c594-3990-9fae-44b5a0795854",
                        "source_sense_id": "8e02d223-efab-35d4-b489-141c63b7a8a4",
